Package: mica-kernel-cx3576
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mos build <mos@example.invalid>
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Description: the cx3576 kernel, firmware and boot outputs for the assembly
 The BSP outputs of the cx3576 board under /usr/lib/mica/board/cx3576/: the
 kernel directory (image, config, release, modules), the firmware files and
 component copyright the support image takes, the board definition and
 evidence, the verity trust certificate the kernel embeds, and the signed
 U-Boot where the board has one. Not for installation into a root: the
 assembly reads it out of the archive.
